```

This code leverages the Dirty Pipe vulnerability to overwrite critical system files and reboot the system, potentially leading to privilege escalation. The vulnerability exploits a race condition in the name-to-path resolution, allowing an attacker to manipulate file paths and gain unauthorized access. Always ensure you're working in a controlled environment and have proper authorization before attempting any such actions.
